{"5414140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Survivecraft","steam_appid":5414140,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Void Rift has opened.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five lands are falling, one after another – and only you stand between the horde and the end of Valdrath. Survivecraft blends the addictive survivor formula with the feel of a classic fantasy RPG: your spells fire on their own while you focus on dodging, positioning and the choices that make every run a new build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run lasts about ten minutes, and in that time the Rift sends everything it has. Hundreds of enemies close in from every side, elite monsters carry deadly traits, events like the Blood Moon turn a calm minute into a fight for survival – and every three and a half minutes a boss tears itself out of the Rift. Survive, level up, and decide with every upgrade what kind of legend you become.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/8697b3b05239705961c763fee9a99775.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/8697b3b05239705961c763fee9a99775.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=1040 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Valdrath – five lands, one Rift<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey leads from the sunlit Emerald Forest through the haunted Deadmire and the burning Ashen Steppe to the frozen Frostpeak – and finally into the Shadow Rift, where the world itself comes apart. Every land has its own enemies, its own hazards and three bosses who guard the way forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone can be played on Normal, Heroic and Abyss. Heroic brings tougher enemies and better loot, while Abyss adds endless tiers with weekly affixes that rewrite the rules. The zone screen even tells you which item level we recommend – and shows you what you are currently wearing – so you always know whether you are ready.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/4687350944d26ea3d2923ee2a1af3136.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/4687350944d26ea3d2923ee2a1af3136.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=936 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thirteen heroes, thirteen ways to fight<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Warrior and the Paladin to the Rogue, the Occultist and the Wyrmcaller: every hero starts with their own spell, their own ultimate and their own rhythm. Chain lightning, returning blades, orbiting soul blades, dragon breath – you will feel the difference within seconds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the build begins. 19 spells can be evolved into something far more powerful, 15 passives shape how you play, and powerful resonances unlock when the right pieces come together. No two runs feel the same – and the best builds are the ones you discover yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/4776df8798a56c79daf096d44f810e19.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/4776df8798a56c79daf096d44f810e19.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=1170 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses you can read – and beat<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivecraft bosses do not cheat. Every attack is announced: glowing lines, shrinking rings, warning zones. Learn the patterns, slip through the gaps, and punish them in the vulnerability windows after their heaviest attacks. 15 zone bosses await – and on Heroic and Abyss they learn new tricks and unleash devastating ultimates.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the zones wait two mega bosses. Kael’Voroth, Lord of the Rift, fights you in three phases with a crystal shield and a five-minute rage timer. And deep below the Rift lurks the Mother of the Horde: a monster with tentacles you must destroy, a swarming brood and a final rage that tests everything you have learned.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/cc0b041cae2f81c6579791da26b0b135.poster.avif?t=1793731975\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/cc0b041cae2f81c6579791da26b0b135.webm?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/cc0b041cae2f81c6579791da26b0b135.mp4?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Halloween Special Event: The Pumpkin Night Falls<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, the Pumpkin Night comes to Valdrath. <strong>Grimmkopf, the Pumpkin King<\/strong> rises in his own arena under the moon – and he does not fight alone. He rains giant pumpkins down on the battlefield, fans out cursed seeds, hurls burning jack-o'-lantern bombs and calls a brood of mini pumpkins that you have to blast from a distance before they explode. This is a long fight with special phases: a <strong>pumpkin flood<\/strong> of mini pumpkins while the king is immune, a <strong>fire wall<\/strong> of flame waves you can only survive by hiding behind giant pumpkins, and <strong>harvest time<\/strong>, where you have to stomp growing pumpkins before they burst and heal him. In his final phase, Midnight, everything he has comes at you at once.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the event straight from the main menu and fight on Normal, Heroic and Abyss.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special loot: every win can drop costumes for your hero – a carved Pumpkin Head, the Witch Hat, a Pumpkin Crown, the Skull Mask and, for Abyss conquerors, the Golden Pumpkin Head. Each one comes with its own glow, embers or souls.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costumes are purely cosmetic. They give no stats, so they never change the balance – they just look great.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The event boss has its own rage timer and does not count towards the Kael'Voroth progress or the leaderboards.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seasonal events – all year round<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pumpkin Night is only the beginning. Survivecraft gets seasonal events with their own event boss, costumes and little surprises. The next one is already finished: from 25 November, Frostbart, the Snow King takes over from the Pumpkin King and fights you in a square ice arena – open presents (not every one is a gift!), dodge walls of snowballs and chase him through the cold while his warmth is the only safe place. His loot: a snowman head, Santa hat, elf hat and a Frost Crown as loot. In December, a 24-door advent calendar adds a small gift behind every door – and if a door hides a costume, it is a special one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More events will follow over the year. Early Access is the perfect time to try them out – tell me which ones you want to see!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Infinite Night<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you are good? Prove it. <strong>The Infinite Night<\/strong> is the weekly high-score hunt: every Monday brings a new night with a fixed seed and a fixed hero. No gear, no talents – everyone starts exactly equal. Every three minutes the night grows deeper, enemies grow stronger and your score multiplier rises.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points for survival time, defeated enemies, elites and bosses.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on rare challenges: hunt down a Hunter, rescue a cursed treasure, accept a trial, win a flawless boss fight.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the weekly and all-time Steam leaderboards (Top 20).<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your result as a card with your rank, your name and a QR code to the store page.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach 25,000, 50,000 or 100,000 points with a hero to unlock exclusive skins for that hero.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/f4e9fa89c07b0dd30678105f1258f35d.poster.avif?t=1793731975\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/f4e9fa89c07b0dd30678105f1258f35d.webm?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/f4e9fa89c07b0dd30678105f1258f35d.mp4?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sanctuary, loot and skins<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs you rebuild your sanctuary room by room. The Forge teaches new techniques, the Blood Altar awakens bloodlines and mutations, and the Library, the Alchemy Lab and the Crypt (where forgotten heroes wake) make you permanently stronger. And behind a sealed door waits something that came from the Rift itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot is a celebration. Chests come in three tiers with animated reveals – spin the prize wheel, or watch the arcane ritual before the lid bursts open. On the battlefield, six kinds of supply crates heal you, regenerate your health, give you a potion, or grant a 30-second power: double damage, faster movement or faster attacks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you can make every hero your own. In the shop you buy signature skins with wings, halos, glowing weapons and auras – and the legendary ones must be earned: clear a zone on Abyss, defeat the Mother of the Horde on Heroic, or master the Infinite Night.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight together<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players, one screen: local co-op shares level-ups and loot, and a fallen friend can be revived. With Steam Remote Play Together your friends can join from anywhere. Controllers are fully supported.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/9cc6ebd4199229f6e1c383616707e418.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/9cc6ebd4199229f6e1c383616707e418.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=780 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made with care<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivecraft is developed by a solo developer. Every hero, boss and monster is built from animated vector parts – drawn to stay readable even in the biggest swarm – and the world of Valdrath comes with its own artbook, “The Chronicles of Valdrath”. We care about the details, and we keep polishing them.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 playable classes<\/strong> – each with its own starter spell, ultimate and stats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19 spells with evolutions<\/strong> and 15 passives – every run is a new build.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 zones, 15 bosses<\/strong>, a boss arena and the mega boss Mother of the Horde.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal events<\/strong> – Halloween Special with the Pumpkin King at launch, Christmas boss and 24-door advent calendar to follow, 14 cosmetic costumes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Infinite Night<\/strong> – weekly high-score mode with Steam leaderboards and shareable result cards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sanctuary<\/strong> – 7 buildable rooms, bloodlines, mutations, transmutation and hidden secrets.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chests and supply crates<\/strong> with animated reveals and 30-second powers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skins for every hero<\/strong> – shop, signature skins and unlockable legendary skins.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op<\/strong> for two players and Steam Remote Play Together.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 achievements<\/strong>, Steam Cloud saves, full controller support, English and German.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access – and beyond<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large part of Survivecraft is already built: five lands, 15 bosses, 13 heroes, the Sanctuary, the Infinite Night and local co-op are in the game and playable today. But I am far from done. I plan to add a lot of new content – bosses, heroes, regions, spells, challenges and seasonal events – so that there is always a reason to jump back in and keep playing. Your feedback shapes the balance, the bosses and every new feature, so please share your ideas and bug reports in the Steam forums. Here is a look at what I have in mind (ideas and plans, not fixed dates):<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/30343726b628ca446995d6f40e9a1029.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/30343726b628ca446995d6f40e9a1029.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=988 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New bosses<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Moon Countess – a ruler of the night who turns the Blood Moon into a weapon.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bell Tower – every toll of the bell changes the arena.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Twins of Dusk – two bosses you have to take down together.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mirror Hero – a duel against yourself and your own build.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More world, more heroes, more challenges<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New regions beyond the five lands of Valdrath.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More heroes with their own spells, ultimates and skins.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New spells, evolutions and resonances.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More challenges and weekly trials, plus new shop items and skins.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance changes based on your runs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seasonal events<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New event bosses with their own costumes and gimmick loot for every season.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More calendar events, small gifts and surprises throughout the year.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And after that?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valdrath is meant to grow. We dream of a tower defense game set in the same universe, where you see the lands, heroes and monsters you know from a completely new perspective. For now it is just an idea – but if you like it, tell us!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Void Rift has opened.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five lands are falling, one after another – and only you stand between the horde and the end of Valdrath. Survivecraft blends the addictive survivor formula with the feel of a classic fantasy RPG: your spells fire on their own while you focus on dodging, positioning and the choices that make every run a new build.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run lasts about ten minutes, and in that time the Rift sends everything it has. Hundreds of enemies close in from every side, elite monsters carry deadly traits, events like the Blood Moon turn a calm minute into a fight for survival – and every three and a half minutes a boss tears itself out of the Rift. Survive, level up, and decide with every upgrade what kind of legend you become.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/8697b3b05239705961c763fee9a99775.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/8697b3b05239705961c763fee9a99775.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=1040 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Valdrath – five lands, one Rift<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey leads from the sunlit Emerald Forest through the haunted Deadmire and the burning Ashen Steppe to the frozen Frostpeak – and finally into the Shadow Rift, where the world itself comes apart. Every land has its own enemies, its own hazards and three bosses who guard the way forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone can be played on Normal, Heroic and Abyss. Heroic brings tougher enemies and better loot, while Abyss adds endless tiers with weekly affixes that rewrite the rules. The zone screen even tells you which item level we recommend – and shows you what you are currently wearing – so you always know whether you are ready.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/4687350944d26ea3d2923ee2a1af3136.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/4687350944d26ea3d2923ee2a1af3136.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=936 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thirteen heroes, thirteen ways to fight<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Warrior and the Paladin to the Rogue, the Occultist and the Wyrmcaller: every hero starts with their own spell, their own ultimate and their own rhythm. Chain lightning, returning blades, orbiting soul blades, dragon breath – you will feel the difference within seconds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the build begins. 19 spells can be evolved into something far more powerful, 15 passives shape how you play, and powerful resonances unlock when the right pieces come together. No two runs feel the same – and the best builds are the ones you discover yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/4776df8798a56c79daf096d44f810e19.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/4776df8798a56c79daf096d44f810e19.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=1170 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses you can read – and beat<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivecraft bosses do not cheat. Every attack is announced: glowing lines, shrinking rings, warning zones. Learn the patterns, slip through the gaps, and punish them in the vulnerability windows after their heaviest attacks. 15 zone bosses await – and on Heroic and Abyss they learn new tricks and unleash devastating ultimates.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the zones wait two mega bosses. Kael’Voroth, Lord of the Rift, fights you in three phases with a crystal shield and a five-minute rage timer. And deep below the Rift lurks the Mother of the Horde: a monster with tentacles you must destroy, a swarming brood and a final rage that tests everything you have learned.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/cc0b041cae2f81c6579791da26b0b135.poster.avif?t=1793731975\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/cc0b041cae2f81c6579791da26b0b135.webm?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/cc0b041cae2f81c6579791da26b0b135.mp4?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Halloween Special Event: The Pumpkin Night Falls<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, the Pumpkin Night comes to Valdrath. <strong>Grimmkopf, the Pumpkin King<\/strong> rises in his own arena under the moon – and he does not fight alone. He rains giant pumpkins down on the battlefield, fans out cursed seeds, hurls burning jack-o'-lantern bombs and calls a brood of mini pumpkins that you have to blast from a distance before they explode. This is a long fight with special phases: a <strong>pumpkin flood<\/strong> of mini pumpkins while the king is immune, a <strong>fire wall<\/strong> of flame waves you can only survive by hiding behind giant pumpkins, and <strong>harvest time<\/strong>, where you have to stomp growing pumpkins before they burst and heal him. In his final phase, Midnight, everything he has comes at you at once.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the event straight from the main menu and fight on Normal, Heroic and Abyss.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special loot: every win can drop costumes for your hero – a carved Pumpkin Head, the Witch Hat, a Pumpkin Crown, the Skull Mask and, for Abyss conquerors, the Golden Pumpkin Head. Each one comes with its own glow, embers or souls.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costumes are purely cosmetic. They give no stats, so they never change the balance – they just look great.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The event boss has its own rage timer and does not count towards the Kael'Voroth progress or the leaderboards.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seasonal events – all year round<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pumpkin Night is only the beginning. Survivecraft gets seasonal events with their own event boss, costumes and little surprises. The next one is already finished: from 25 November, Frostbart, the Snow King takes over from the Pumpkin King and fights you in a square ice arena – open presents (not every one is a gift!), dodge walls of snowballs and chase him through the cold while his warmth is the only safe place. His loot: a snowman head, Santa hat, elf hat and a Frost Crown as loot. In December, a 24-door advent calendar adds a small gift behind every door – and if a door hides a costume, it is a special one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More events will follow over the year. Early Access is the perfect time to try them out – tell me which ones you want to see!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Infinite Night<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you are good? Prove it. <strong>The Infinite Night<\/strong> is the weekly high-score hunt: every Monday brings a new night with a fixed seed and a fixed hero. No gear, no talents – everyone starts exactly equal. Every three minutes the night grows deeper, enemies grow stronger and your score multiplier rises.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points for survival time, defeated enemies, elites and bosses.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on rare challenges: hunt down a Hunter, rescue a cursed treasure, accept a trial, win a flawless boss fight.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the weekly and all-time Steam leaderboards (Top 20).<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your result as a card with your rank, your name and a QR code to the store page.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach 25,000, 50,000 or 100,000 points with a hero to unlock exclusive skins for that hero.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/f4e9fa89c07b0dd30678105f1258f35d.poster.avif?t=1793731975\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/f4e9fa89c07b0dd30678105f1258f35d.webm?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/f4e9fa89c07b0dd30678105f1258f35d.mp4?t=1793731975\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sanctuary, loot and skins<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs you rebuild your sanctuary room by room. The Forge teaches new techniques, the Blood Altar awakens bloodlines and mutations, and the Library, the Alchemy Lab and the Crypt (where forgotten heroes wake) make you permanently stronger. And behind a sealed door waits something that came from the Rift itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot is a celebration. Chests come in three tiers with animated reveals – spin the prize wheel, or watch the arcane ritual before the lid bursts open. On the battlefield, six kinds of supply crates heal you, regenerate your health, give you a potion, or grant a 30-second power: double damage, faster movement or faster attacks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you can make every hero your own. In the shop you buy signature skins with wings, halos, glowing weapons and auras – and the legendary ones must be earned: clear a zone on Abyss, defeat the Mother of the Horde on Heroic, or master the Infinite Night.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight together<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players, one screen: local co-op shares level-ups and loot, and a fallen friend can be revived. With Steam Remote Play Together your friends can join from anywhere. Controllers are fully supported.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/9cc6ebd4199229f6e1c383616707e418.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/9cc6ebd4199229f6e1c383616707e418.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=780 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made with care<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivecraft is developed by a solo developer. Every hero, boss and monster is built from animated vector parts – drawn to stay readable even in the biggest swarm – and the world of Valdrath comes with its own artbook, “The Chronicles of Valdrath”. We care about the details, and we keep polishing them.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 playable classes<\/strong> – each with its own starter spell, ultimate and stats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19 spells with evolutions<\/strong> and 15 passives – every run is a new build.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 zones, 15 bosses<\/strong>, a boss arena and the mega boss Mother of the Horde.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal events<\/strong> – Halloween Special with the Pumpkin King at launch, Christmas boss and 24-door advent calendar to follow, 14 cosmetic costumes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Infinite Night<\/strong> – weekly high-score mode with Steam leaderboards and shareable result cards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sanctuary<\/strong> – 7 buildable rooms, bloodlines, mutations, transmutation and hidden secrets.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chests and supply crates<\/strong> with animated reveals and 30-second powers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skins for every hero<\/strong> – shop, signature skins and unlockable legendary skins.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op<\/strong> for two players and Steam Remote Play Together.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 achievements<\/strong>, Steam Cloud saves, full controller support, English and German.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access – and beyond<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large part of Survivecraft is already built: five lands, 15 bosses, 13 heroes, the Sanctuary, the Infinite Night and local co-op are in the game and playable today. But I am far from done. I plan to add a lot of new content – bosses, heroes, regions, spells, challenges and seasonal events – so that there is always a reason to jump back in and keep playing. Your feedback shapes the balance, the bosses and every new feature, so please share your ideas and bug reports in the Steam forums. Here is a look at what I have in mind (ideas and plans, not fixed dates):<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras\/30343726b628ca446995d6f40e9a1029.avif?t=1793731975\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/extras_big\/30343726b628ca446995d6f40e9a1029.avif?t=1793731975 width=1560 height=988 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New bosses<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Moon Countess – a ruler of the night who turns the Blood Moon into a weapon.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bell Tower – every toll of the bell changes the arena.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Twins of Dusk – two bosses you have to take down together.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mirror Hero – a duel against yourself and your own build.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More world, more heroes, more challenges<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New regions beyond the five lands of Valdrath.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More heroes with their own spells, ultimates and skins.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New spells, evolutions and resonances.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More challenges and weekly trials, plus new shop items and skins.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance changes based on your runs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seasonal events<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New event bosses with their own costumes and gimmick loot for every season.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More calendar events, small gifts and surprises throughout the year.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And after that?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valdrath is meant to grow. We dream of a tower defense game set in the same universe, where you see the lands, heroes and monsters you know from a completely new perspective. For now it is just an idea – but if you like it, tell us!<\/p>","short_description":"Survive ten minutes of pure horde in the dark fantasy world of Valdrath! 13 heroes, evolving spells, boss fights in blazing arenas and epic loot. Rebuild your ruined Sanctuary between runs – solo or in local co-op.","supported_languages":"English, German","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/4a59b62a26eebf9712922444f81a680bc4319562\/header.jpg?t=1793731975","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/c9e3916587b2a6b64804d101664c1526bb4bb003\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793731975","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/c9e3916587b2a6b64804d101664c1526bb4bb003\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793731975","website":"http:\/\/survivecraft.jakeey.de\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core CPU, 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 \/ OpenGL 3.3 compatible graphics card with 1 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 700 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Gamepad recommended. Supports Steam Remote Play Together.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core CPU, 3.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 \/ AMD RX 560 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 700 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> <\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2026 JakeeY. Alle Rechte vorbehalten.","developers":["JakeeY"],"publishers":["GamerCrew"],"demos":[{"appid":5427030,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":599,"final":449,"discount_percent":25,"initial_formatted":"$5.99","final_formatted":"$4.49"},"packages":[1869080],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Survivecraft","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1869080,"percent_savings_text":"-25% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Survivecraft - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$5.99<\/span> $4.49","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":449}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":39,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen Co-op"},{"id":24,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/63d40e059826bdf3017915fa3b3958e6dc731baa\/ss_63d40e059826bdf3017915fa3b3958e6dc731baa.600x338.jpg?t=1793731975","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/63d40e059826bdf3017915fa3b3958e6dc731baa\/ss_63d40e059826bdf3017915fa3b3958e6dc731baa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793731975"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/1cc5031046c4b4e28040bdb09341feb488dbf316\/ss_1cc5031046c4b4e28040bdb09341feb488dbf316.600x338.jpg?t=1793731975","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/1cc5031046c4b4e28040bdb09341feb488dbf316\/ss_1cc5031046c4b4e28040bdb09341feb488dbf316.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793731975"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/e74a194a5055c83c6f92c0ed9b7d7826913e91c4\/ss_e74a194a5055c83c6f92c0ed9b7d7826913e91c4.600x338.jpg?t=1793731975","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/e74a194a5055c83c6f92c0ed9b7d7826913e91c4\/ss_e74a194a5055c83c6f92c0ed9b7d7826913e91c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793731975"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/d1a7ba7d4f4c55cdfa8e4ce7c5c9529a918b7d73\/ss_d1a7ba7d4f4c55cdfa8e4ce7c5c9529a918b7d73.600x338.jpg?t=1793731975","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/d1a7ba7d4f4c55cdfa8e4ce7c5c9529a918b7d73\/ss_d1a7ba7d4f4c55cdfa8e4ce7c5c9529a918b7d73.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793731975"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/b6ccdfb07779c048015b1404560c5fb721c04ddd\/ss_b6ccdfb07779c048015b1404560c5fb721c04ddd.600x338.jpg?t=1793731975","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/b6ccdfb07779c048015b1404560c5fb721c04ddd\/ss_b6ccdfb07779c048015b1404560c5fb721c04ddd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793731975"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/f02b827ac42cca1b24b5f647b0e1772e76a76375\/ss_f02b827ac42cca1b24b5f647b0e1772e76a76375.600x338.jpg?t=1793731975","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/f02b827ac42cca1b24b5f647b0e1772e76a76375\/ss_f02b827ac42cca1b24b5f647b0e1772e76a76375.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793731975"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/4c9b244b800d7027a9589e76c69c9476e7f9c8e6\/ss_4c9b244b800d7027a9589e76c69c9476e7f9c8e6.600x338.jpg?t=1793731975","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5414140\/4c9b2